{"name":"Tyraturos","status":"ok","title":"Tyraturos","pageId":143071,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>This article is about the city in central <a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a>. For the tharch of the same name, see <a href=\"/wiki/Tyraturos_(tharch)\" title=\"Tyraturos (tharch)\">Tyraturos (tharch)</a>.</i></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Tyraturos\" title=\"Category:Maps of Tyraturos\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Tyraturos</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE.M_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.M-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East\" title=\"Unapproachable East\">Unapproachable East</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Tyraturos\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Tyraturos\">Inhabitants of  Tyraturos</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Tyraturos</b><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>note 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> was city located in the country of <a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a> during the mid–14<sup>th</sup> century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE.p4_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.p4-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE.M_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.M-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tyraturos?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city in the central region of the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Tharch\" title=\"Tharch\">tharch</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Tyraturos_(tharch)\" title=\"Tyraturos (tharch)\">Tyraturos</a> north of <a href=\"/wiki/Bezantur\" title=\"Bezantur\">Bezantur</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE.M_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.M-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p11_3-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The city's <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHlyYXR1cm9zL1Rvd2VyX0Rpc3RyaWN0P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Tyraturos/Tower District (page does not exist)\">Tower District</span> was the location of the <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterhouse_Arena\" title=\"Slaughterhouse Arena\">Slaughterhouse Arena</a> and the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmF6YWFyXyhUeXJhdHVyb3MpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Bazaar (Tyraturos) (page does not exist)\">Bazaar</span>. Other districts included <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHlyYXR1cm9zL0Vhc3RfUGxhemE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Tyraturos/East Plaza (page does not exist)\">East Plaza</span> and <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHlyYXR1cm9zL0hpZ2h3YXRlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Tyraturos/Highwater (page does not exist)\">Highwater</span>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-NW1_6-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NW1-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tyraturos?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tyraturos was founded during an age of expansion of <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a> under the leadership of <a href=\"/wiki/Anhurtep\" title=\"Anhurtep\">Anhurtep</a>. The city was eventually claimed by Thay and was part of that country as of the <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">Year of the Prince, 1357 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE.p4_5-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE.p4-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>By the late 15<sup>th</sup> century DR, Tyraturos had at least five separate <a href=\"/wiki/Gladiator\" title=\"Gladiator\">gladiatorial</a> arenas with <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/The_Slaughterhouse\" title=\"The Slaughterhouse\">the Slaughterhouse</a> being the most exclusive one. The Slaughterhouse recruited its Fresh Blood gladiators from the city's Bazaar.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-NW_7-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NW-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-NW1_6-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NW1-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tyraturos?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Notes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tyraturos?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<small><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">The <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Old Empires (sourcebook)\">Old Empires (sourcebook)</a> incorrectly labels this as \"Tyraturas.\"</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></small>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tyraturos?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Video Games</dt>\n<dd><i><a href=\"/wiki/Neverwinter:_Red_Harvest\" title=\"Neverwinter: Red Harvest\">Neverwinter: Red Harvest</a></i> • <i><a href=\"/wiki/Neverwinter:_Red_Harvest_II:_The_Soul_Collector\" title=\"Neverwinter: Red Harvest II: The Soul Collector\">Neverwinter: Red Harvest II: The Soul Collector</a></i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tyraturos?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-OE.M-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.M_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.M_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE.M_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in <a href=\"/wiki/Scott_Bennie\" title=\"Scott Bennie\">Scott Bennie</a> (February 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Old Empires (sourcebook)\">Old Empires</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Breault\" title=\"Mike Breault\">Mike Breault</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc